BT 1 0 0 1 0 94 Tm 11.4 TL 0 0 0 rg /F2+0 8.6 Tf 11.4 TL (F.1 Master position statement.) Tj /F3+0 8.6 Tf 11.4 TL ( R5.29 is the Contract Diligence Baseline for MCRS-MOD-001. It defines a mechanically captured) Tj T* (macro\003micro isolation architecture with COMFORT and SPORT modes; requirements REQ-M01 to REQ-M28 with verification methods) Tj T* (and quantitative-limit structures for power loss, rescue, lateral-g policy, fault-recovery classes, stop curve, horizontal load path and) Tj T* (sensor independence; the SIM-001 verification skeleton; gates G0\003G5; phases Ph0\003Ph3; risks R-01 to R-26; a module-visible mass) Tj T* (table with P50 and P90 reported against the declared confidence level; host WBS budgets for V-L and V-H under a 100 kg occupant) Tj T* (policy; and an explicit packaging residual \(V-L \021370 mm and V-H \021240 mm on the H-point definition, OPEN , P0\). TRL remains 2\0033.) Tj T* (The Legal Owner is Amirbahador Atai. No test result, certification, patentability or freedom-to-operate is asserted. Remaining work is) Tj T* (evidence and formalisation: D0 animation, SIM-001, single-tower bench, ICD-001 and STR-001 freeze, packaging re-baseline,) Tj T* (independent reviewer appointment, name clearance and counsel-led IP filing.) Tj T* ET
